WEBVTT

00:00:58.110 --> 00:01:08.180
They stretch a thousand miles beneath your feet without a sound.

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:19.940
They stretch a thousand miles beneath your feet without a sound.

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:31.500
The oldest living network ever laid into the ground.

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:41.290
They pull the phosphorus from stone and hand it to the root.

00:01:41.590 --> 00:01:52.470
They pull the phosphorus from stone and hand it to the root.

00:01:52.770 --> 00:02:05.100
Without 'em, ninety percent of all our plants won't bear a fruit.

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:15.030
When one tree thirsts, the water moves from those who have to spare.

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:26.740
When one tree thirsts, the water moves from those who have to spare.

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:59.750
A dying sapling fed by neighbors — fungi put it there.

00:03:00.050 --> 00:03:08.800
They lock the carbon in the soil, keep it from the sky.

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:18.570
They lock the carbon in the soil, keep it from the sky.

00:03:18.870 --> 00:03:52.240
A climate tool a billion years before we wondered why.

00:03:52.540 --> 00:04:03.460
We're just beginning now to hear what they have always known.

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:14.730
We're just beginning now to hear what they have always known.

00:04:15.030 --> 00:04:19.045
The wisest thing beneath this earth — and we've been walking on it alone.

